{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 3, "text": "这是中华人民共和国成立后新创的一套文字。经修订，目前正在积极推行之中。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 507, "w": 1403, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这是中华人民共和国成立后新创的一套文字。经修订，目前正在积极推行之中。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 507, "w": 1403, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 4, "text": "一、布依拼音文字的产生", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 583, "w": 438, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一、布依拼音文字的产生", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 583, "w": 438, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 5, "text": "中华人民共和国成立后，为落实党的民族平等政策，促进各民族社会经济文化教育", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 644, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "中华人民共和国成立后，为落实党的民族平等政策，促进各民族社会经济文化教育", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 644, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 6, "text": "的发展繁荣，党和政府根据各民族人民的意愿，帮助一些没有自己民族文字又迫切要求", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 712, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的发展繁荣，党和政府根据各民族人民的意愿，帮助一些没有自己民族文字又迫切要求", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 712, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 7, "text": "创制文字的民族创制了文字。布依族的新文字——拼音文字就是在这种情况下产生的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 781, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "创制文字的民族创制了文字。布依族的新文字——拼音文字就是在这种情况下产生的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 781, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 8, "text": "布依族新文字具有严密的科学性。这不仅表现在它属于比较先进的文字类型即拼", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 845, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族新文字具有严密的科学性。这不仅表现在它属于比较先进的文字类型即拼", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 845, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 9, "text": "音文字，还表现在它的创制是建立在较充分的科学调查研究基础上，与布依语的特点相", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 913, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "音文字，还表现在它的创制是建立在较充分的科学调查研究基础上，与布依语的特点相", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 913, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 10, "text": "吻合。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 982, "w": 109, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "吻合。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 982, "w": 109, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 11, "text": "在确定布依文方案以前，中国科学院少数民族语言调查第一工作队曾对布依语进行", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1046, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在确定布依文方案以前，中国科学院少数民族语言调查第一工作队曾对布依语进行", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1046, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 12, "text": "了全面系统的调查研究，并和同一语支关系密切的壮语进行了比较研究，认为布依语内", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1118, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了全面系统的调查研究，并和同一语支关系密切的壮语进行了比较研究，认为布依语内", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 1118, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 13, "text": "部差别不大，只需创立一种文字。同时，由于壮族和布依族的族源关系非常紧密，布依语", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1183, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "部差别不大，只需创立一种文字。同时，由于壮族和布依族的族源关系非常紧密，布依语", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1183, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 14, "text": "和壮语非常接近，在语音上的对应相当整齐，语法结构也很一致。为了便于布依族和壮", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1247, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "和壮语非常接近，在语音上的对应相当整齐，语法结构也很一致。为了便于布依族和壮", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1247, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 15, "text": "族人民之间经济、文化、科学的交流，1956年11月在贵阳召开的布依族语言文字问题科", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1316, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族人民之间经济、文化、科学的交流，1956年11月在贵阳召开的布依族语言文字问题科", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1316, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 16, "text": "学讨论会决定采取布依文和壮文联盟的方针，并通过了布依文方案。这样，布依族严密、", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1380, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "学讨论会决定采取布依文和壮文联盟的方针，并通过了布依文方案。这样，布依族严密、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1380, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 17, "text": "科学、系统、规范的母语文字——布依拼音文字终于诞生了。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1448, "w": 1049, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "科学、系统、规范的母语文字——布依拼音文字终于诞生了。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1448, "w": 1049, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 18, "text": "二、布依拼音文字的构成及特点", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1513, "w": 555, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "二、布依拼音文字的构成及特点", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 1513, "w": 555, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 19, "text": "布依文拼音文字于1956年创制，1981年修改，但并没有改变其拼音文字的性质。拼", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1581, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依文拼音文字于1956年创制，1981年修改，但并没有改变其拼音文字的性质。拼", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1581, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 20, "text": "音文字属表音文字，是一种比较先进的文字类型。它由数量有限的字母构成。字母一般", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1650, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "音文字属表音文字，是一种比较先进的文字类型。它由数量有限的字母构成。字母一般", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1650, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 21, "text": "为20个到30个。每个字母代表一个音位。只要掌握字母和拼音规则，就可写下来，看到", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1718, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "为20个到30个。每个字母代表一个音位。只要掌握字母和拼音规则，就可写下来，看到", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1718, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 22, "text": "就可念出来，易写、易记、易认。这些优点是非拼音文字难以比拟的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1778, "w": 1198, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "就可念出来，易写、易记、易认。这些优点是非拼音文字难以比拟的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1778, "w": 1198, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 23, "text": "1956年的布依文方案（试行）以拉丁字母为基础，33个字母中有22 个拉丁字母，11", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1823, "w": 1480, "h": 83}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "1956年的布依文方案（试行）以拉丁字母为基础，33个字母中有22 个拉丁字母，11", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1823, "w": 1480, "h": 83}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 24, "text": "个非拉丁字母。1981年修改的文字方案全部采用26 个拉丁字母，取消了原文字方案中", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1911, "w": 1560, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个非拉丁字母。1981年修改的文字方案全部采用26 个拉丁字母，取消了原文字方案中", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1911, "w": 1560, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 25, "text": "的非拉丁字母。", "bbox_px": {"x": 132, "y": 1978, "w": 278, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的非拉丁字母。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 132, "y": 1978, "w": 278, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 26, "text": "布依拼音文字方案由字母形式、声母、韵母和声调符号几个部分构成。1956年的文", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 2044, "w": 1475, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依拼音文字方案由字母形式、声母、韵母和声调符号几个部分构成。1956年的文", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 2044, "w": 1475, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 27, "text": "字方案以龙里羊场作为布依文的读音参考点。这套文字有33个字母（其中包括5个声", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2112, "w": 1552, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "字方案以龙里羊场作为布依文的读音参考点。这套文字有33个字母（其中包括5个声", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2112, "w": 1552, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 93, "line_no": 28, "text": "调字母）、23个声母和120个韵母。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2181, "w": 611, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "调字母）、23个声母和120个韵母。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2181, "w": 611, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
